Stop, stop!  Nice ideas, but they would make hack so complex that IMHO it
will not be fun to play anymore.  I like the fact that you can cover the
dungeon a level at a time rather than having to climb up and down just
to finish one level.  Also, as you mentioned, make a 3-D hack would be 
unrealistic using ASCII.  And graphics???... (well that's another story).
Beside 3-D games always confused me since they never give a realistic and
clear view of the 3-D world.

That's what I think, but you don't have to.

